dry-run 断言先定位 section。）\n\n1. 正常路径：前置条件 = task6 完成；输入 = 无；操作 = `go build -o bin/rick ./cmd/rick && go test ./internal/cmd/... ./internal/handler/... -timeout 60s -v`；预期 = build 成功，测试全绿。\n2. 边界（human-loop dry-run + dream 扫描过滤 + ctrl --job 缺失）：前置条件 = build 成功 + 存在「全 success」与「未完成」的 job；输入 = `human-loop --dry-run '测试主题'`、`dream --dry-run`、`ctrl`（无 --job）；操作 = 依次运行；预期 = human-loop 输出含 `sense_loop`；dream 只列「完成且未 dream」的 job（排除未完成/已 dream，按 job 号升序截断）；ctrl 报 `--job flag is required` exit 非 0。\n3. 异常（learning 缺数据 + ctrl doing 目录不存在）：前置条件 = build 成功；输入 = `learning job_N`（doing/tasks.json 不存在）、`ctrl --dry-run --job job_N`（doing 目录不存在）；操作 = 运行；预期 = learning 报 `tasks.json not found` exit 非 0 不 panic；ctrl 报 `doing directory not found` exit 非 0。\n===DOMAIN===\ntotal 84\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys  4096 Aug 17 01:15 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 9 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys  4096 Aug  7 20:00 ..\n-rw-r--r-- 1 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys  6891 Aug  7 20:00 architecture.md\n-rw-rw-r-- 1 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys  7888 Aug 13 01:17 bugs.md\n-rw-rw-r-- 1 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys  7950 Aug 13 00:33 commands.md\n-rw-rw-r-- 1 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys  1653 Aug 13 01:17 env.md\n-rw-r--r-- 1 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys  3117 Aug  7 19:53 go-patterns.md\n-rw-rw-r-- 1 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys  5274 Aug 13 01:17 pi-runtime.md\n-rw-rw-r-- 1 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys  4360 Aug 12 19:30 project-conventions.md\n-rw-r--r-- 1 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys  1366 Aug 17 01:16 README.md\n-rw-rw-r-- 1 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys 10670 Aug 17 01:15 rick-spec.md\n-rw-rw-r-- 1 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys  7906 Aug 17 01:09 spec.md\n-rw-r--r-- 1 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys  2808 Aug  7 19:53 testing-conventions.md\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1786909926329}]}
