查结果。\n\n---\n\n## 推进顺序（5 阶段,允许反向回流）\n\n| 阶段 | 名称 | 子阶段 | human 必须给出 |\n|------|------|--------|--------------|\n| S | 问题确认 | — | 现状补充 + **期望** + **差距**(三者均需 human 判断) |\n| E | 视角生成 | — | **原创视角**(基于 research 跨领域调研的候选,human 综合) |\n| N | 矛盾判断 | N1 矛盾生成 | 对系统矛盾状态的理解 |\n|  |  | N2 主要矛盾判断 | **主要矛盾**(三维打分:根本性/全局性/决定性) |\n| S-R | 辩证逆转 | — | 逆转逻辑判断(\"若 X 必然,实现 Y 应当如何?\") |\n| EC | 良知批判 | — | **跃迁方向**(降维/升维/维持) |\n\n```\nS ⇄ E ⇄ N ⇄ S-R ⇄ EC\n↑                    ↑\n└── 跃迁/反向回流 ──┘\nEXIT=0\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1786909953275},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_01_ET_gctCXV1wtQWrPbTiBmbH1722","toolName":"bash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"=== ctrl (no --job) ===\nError: --job flag is required (e.g. rick ctrl --job job_1)\nUsage:\n  rick ctrl [flags]\n\nFlags:\n  -h, --help   help for ctrl\n\nGlobal Flags:\n      --dry-run      Run in dry-run mode without making changes\n      --job string   Specify job ID (e.g., job_1)\n  -v, --verbose      Enable verbose output\n\nError: --job flag is required (e.g. rick ctrl --job job_1)\nEXIT=1\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1786909953275},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Current state:\n- `human-loop --dry-run '测试主题'` → contains `sense loop` (with space). It also contains `sense_loop`? Let me check. The output shows `# sense loop（main agent 协议）` and the template body references `sense_loop(你)` and `sense_loop 必须` etc. But the test requires the output to contain `sense_loop` (with underscore). Let me check if the human-loop dry-run output contains `sense_loop` (underscore).\n\nThe first line is `# sense loop（main agent 协议）` (space). But the body contains `sense_loop` references. Let me grep.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_Rlwbm36TDr4s3K5Bs9ZF5747","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"cd /workdir/sunquan20/AI_CODING/rick && /tmp/rick_task7_probe human-loop --dry-run '测试主题' 2>&1 | grep -c 'sense_loop'; echo \"---dream dry-run---\"; /tmp/rick_task