oaded. Good.\n\nFor ctrl --dry-run --job job_999: runCtrlDryRun → SaveCtrlPrompt → GenerateCtrlPromptFile → \"doing directory not found\" error before config. Good, no config needed.\n\nSo all behavioral tests can run in the isolated fixture without config. \n\nBut wait, there's a subtlety with env.Ensure after migration. The task7 spec says the orchestration includes env.Ensure. For the human-loop non-dry-run, it would call env.Ensure (which might need config/pi). But for dry-run, it shouldn't. The test only uses dry-run for human-loop, so no env.Ensure needed.\n\nActually, let me reconsider the human-loop test. The test method boundary says `human-loop --dry-run '测试主题'` output contains `sense_loop`. This is dry-run. Good.\n\nNow, one more concern: the isolated fixture approach requires the binary to resolve `.rick` from cwd. Since I run with cwd=fixture_dir, GetRickDir() = fixture_dir/.rick. \n\nBut `getRickDirName()` checks os.Args[0] binary name for `_dev` suffix. Our binary is named `rick` (not `_dev`), so `.rick`. Good. But wait, if I name the binary `/tmp/xxx/rick`, filepath.Base is \"rick\", no _dev. Good.\n\nLet me now also verify the dream --dry-run works in an isolated fixture (no loops/skills). Let me test it quickly.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_XRqpB0atgRv5wMdJogiZ9514","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"set -e\nFX=$(mktemp -d /tmp/rick_fx_XXXX)\nmkdir -p \"$FX/.rick/jobs/job_1/doing\" \"$FX/.rick/jobs/job_2/doing\" \"$FX/.rick/jobs/job_3/doing\" \"$FX/.rick/jobs/job_4/doing\" \"$FX/.rick/jobs/job_5/doing\" \"$FX/.rick/jobs/job_6/doing\" \"$FX/.rick/jobs/job_7/doing\" \"$FX/.rick/jobs/job_8/doing\" \"$FX/.rick/jobs/job_9/doing\" \"$FX/.rick/dream\"\ncat > \"$FX/.rick/jobs/job_1/doing/tasks.json\" <<'EOF'\n{\"tasks\":[{\"task_id\":\"task1\",\"task_name\":\"a\",\"status\":\"success\"}]}\nEOF\ncat > \"$FX/.rick/jobs/job_2/doing/tasks.json\" <<'EOF'\n{\"tasks\":[{\"task_id\":\"task1\",\"task_name\":\"a\",\"status\":\"success\"}]}\nEOF\ncat > \"$FX/.rick/jobs/job_3/doing/tasks.json\" <<'EOF'\n{\"tasks\":[{\"task_id\":\"task1\",\"task_name\":\"a\",\"status\":\"success\"}]}\nEOF\ncat > \"$FX/.rick/jobs/job_4/doing/tasks.json\" <<'EOF'\n{\"tasks\":[{\"task_id\":\"task1\",\"task_name\":\"a\",\"status\":\"running\"}]}\nEOF\nfor n in 5 6 7 8; do cat > \"$FX/.rick/jobs/job_$n/doing/tasks.json\" <<'EOF'\n{\"tasks\":[{\"task_id\":\"task1\",\"task_name\":\"a\",\"status\":\"success\"}]}\nEOF\ndone\ntouch \"$FX/.rick/dream/dream_run_job_3_log.md\"\necho \"=== dream --dry-run in fixture ===\"\ncd \"$FX\" && /tmp/rick_task7_probe dream --dry-run 2>&1 | head -20\necho \"EXIT=${PIPESTATUS[0]}\"\necho \"FX=$FX\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":629,"output":6020,"cacheRead":60288,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":5516,"totalTokens":66937,"cost":{"input":0.000273615,"output":0.0052374000000000006,"cacheRead":0.00021854400000000001,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.005729559}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1786910001239,"responseId":"290b96bf-25d2-41f0-93ca-e139dfc1087a","rawStopReason":"tool_calls"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_XRqpB0atgRv5wMdJogiZ9514","toolName":"bash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"=== dream --dry-run in fixture ===\n[DRY-RUN] Pending jobs (5): [job_1 job_2 job_5 job_6 job_7]\n[DRY-RUN] Dream prompt:\n\n# Rick Dream Phase\n\n你是一个资深软件工程师，负责跨 job 全局反思与知识进化。Dream 阶段的核心任务：**从多个 job 的执行记录中提炼跨 job 共性模式，进化现有 loops 和 skills，淘汰过时的条目**。\n\n## 角色定位\n\n- **范围**：仅允许修改 `.rick/loops/`（`<loops_dir>`）、`.rick/skills/`（`<skills_dir>`）和 `.rick/domain/`（`<domain_dir>`）\n- **禁止**：修改任何业务源代码及其他 `.rick/` 目录\n- **输出**：更新 loops/skills/domain；每个处理的 job 写入 `dream_run_{job_id}_log.md`\n\n---\n\n## 可用的项目 Loops\n\n## 可用的项目 Loops\n\n（暂无项目 Loop 记录）\nEXIT=0\nFX=/tmp/rick_fx_ZdUB\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1786910065370},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The dream --dry-run in isolated fixture works an